# Riding mode's screen (ride-display plan, PR 2). tests/run.sh compiles every path listed in tests/l10n/*.sources and
# runs each tests/l10n/**Test.java from the repository root. RidingBrightnessTest covers the Volt auto curve and its
# learning (BrightnessCurve), the brightness choice and slider (RidingBrightness), the rotation setting
# (RidingRotation), the status-bar setting (RidingBars), and that no source writes Android's brightness setting.
src/com/jjricks/volt/BrightnessCurve.java
src/com/jjricks/volt/RidingBrightness.java
src/com/jjricks/volt/RidingRotation.java
src/com/jjricks/volt/RidingBars.java
tests/l10n/RidingBrightnessTest.java
